              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1407.6359"}> arXiv:1407.6359
              )
          %p
            Identification of the
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
