                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{N} = (2,0)
            black M5-brane sitting at the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ADE+singularity"} A-type singularity
            of an
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
