                  %em Current Algebra Formulation of M-theory based on E11 Kac-Moody Algebra
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1701.06894"} arXiv:1701.06894
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shotaro+Shiba"}> Shotaro Shiba
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hirotaka+Sugawara"} Hirotaka Sugawara
                %em M2- and M5-branes in E11 Current Algebra Formulation of M-theory
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1709.07169"}> arXiv:1709.07169
                )
          %p Further solutions:
          %ul
            %li
              A. M. Ghezelbash,
              %em M-Branes on Minimal Surfaces
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.07855"}> arXiv:2407.07855
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %h4#wrapped_on_hyperbolic_3manifolds Wrapped on hyperbolic 3-manifolds
          %p
            Solutions to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D11+N%3D1+supergravity"} D=11 N=1 supergravity
            describing
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wrapped+brane"} wrapped
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/hyperbolic+3-manifolds"} hyperbolic 3-manifolds
            (with application to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3d-3d+correspondence"} 3d-3d correspondence
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/proof"} proof
            of the
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/volume+conjecture"} volume conjecture
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jerome+Gauntlett"}> Jerome Gauntlett
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Nakwoo+Kim"} Nakwoo Kim
                = succeed "," do
