            %li#BilalMetzger03
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Adel+Bilal"}> Adel Bilal
                , Steffen Metzger,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Anomaly cancellation in M-theory: a critical review
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0307152"} arXiv:hep-th/0307152
          %p
            that this term disappears (cancels) when properly taking into account the singularity of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergravity+C-field"} supergravity C-field
            at the locus of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+brane"} black
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
          %p This argument is recalled in
          %ul
            %li#Harvey05
