              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                , Constantinos Papageorgakis, Maximilian Schmidt-Sommerfeld,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em M5-Branes, D4-Branes and Quantum 5D super-Yang-Mills
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1012.2882"} arXiv:1012.2882
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chong-Sun+Chu"}> Chong-Sun Chu
                , Sheng-Lan Ko,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Non-abelian Action for Multiple Five-Branes with Self-Dual Tensors
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1203.4224"} arXiv:1203.4224
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Neil+Lambert"}> Neil Lambert
                , Miles Owen,
                %em Charged Chiral Fermions from M5-Branes
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.07766"}> arXiv:1802.07766
                )
          %p
            See also (
            %a{:href => "#Witten11"}> Witten 11
            ).
          %h3#OpenM5BranesReferences Open M5-branes
          %p
            Discussion of open M5-branes stretching between
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M9-branes"} M9-branes
            and ending in a
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yang+monopole"} Yang monopole
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Bergshoeff"}> Eric Bergshoeff
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gary+Gibbons"} Gary Gibbons
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Paul+Townsend"} Paul Townsend
              = succeed "," do
                %em Open M5-branes
              %strong 97
              (2006) 231601 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0607193"}> arXiv:hep-th/0607193
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.231601"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.97.231601
          %p
            The corresponding non-supersymmetric 4-branes as seen in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string+theory"} heterotic string theory
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Justin+Kaidi"}> Justin Kaidi
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kantaro+Ohmori"} Kantaro Ohmori
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yuji+Tachikawa"} Yuji Tachikawa
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kazuya+Yonekura"} Kazuya Yonekura
                %em Non-supersymmetric heterotic branes
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.17623"}> arXiv:2303.17623
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Justin+Kaidi"}> Justin Kaidi
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Non-Supersymmetric Heterotic Branes
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://cds.cern.ch/record/2881994"} cds:2881994
          %h3#nonabelian_2form_fields Nonabelian 2-form fields
          %p
            The fact that the worldvolume theory of the M5-brane should support fields that are
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/self-dual+higher+gauge+theory"} self-dual
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connections+on+a+2-bundle"} connections on a 2-bundle
            (
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo ∼
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \sim
            a
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gerbe"} gerbe
          %ul
            %li#Witten07
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Conformal+field+theory+in+four+and+six+dimensions"} Conformal field theory in four and six dimensions
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ulrike+Tillmann"} Ulrike Tillmann
              = succeed "," do
                %em Topology, Geometry and Quantum Field Theory: Proceedings of the 2002 Oxford Symposium in Honour of the 60th Birthday of Graeme Segal
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0712.0157"} arXiv:0712.0157
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511526398.017"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511526398.017
          %p as well as sections 3 and 4 of
          %ul
            %li#Witten09
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
              ,
              %em Geometric Langlands From Six Dimensions
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0905.2720"}> arXiv:0905.2720
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Proposals for how to implement this are for instance in
          %ul#SSW11
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chong-Sun+Chu"}> Chong-Sun Chu
                ,
                %em
                  A Theory of Non-Abelian Tensor Gauge Field with Non-Abelian Gauge Symmetry
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi G
                        %mo ×
                        %mi G
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G \times G
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1108.5131"}> arXiv:1108.5131
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Henning+Samtleben"}> Henning Samtleben
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ergin+Sezgin"} Ergin Sezgin
                %em (1,0) superconformal models in six dimensions
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1108.4060"}> arXiv:1108.4060
                )
          %p
            A formal proposal is
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/7d+Chern-Simons+theory+and+the+5-brane"} here
          %h3#more_on_the_holographic_description More on the holographic description
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexei+Nurmagambetov"}> Alexei Nurmagambetov
              , I. Y. Park,
              %em On the M5 and the AdS7/CFT6 Correspondence
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0110192"}> arXiv:hep-th/0110192
              )
          %h3#more_on_the_algebraic_topology More on the algebraic topology
          %ul
            %li#Witten2000
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"}> Edward Witten
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Duality relations among topological effects in string theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9912086"} arXiv:hep-th/9912086
            %li#Sati10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
                ,
                %em Geometric and topological structures related to M-branes II: Twisted String and String^c structures
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1007.5419"}> arXiv:1007.5419
                )
            %li#Sati
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"}> Hisham Sati
                ,
                %em
                  Twisted topological structures related to M-branes II: Twisted
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi Wu
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Wu
                  and
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi Wu
